msgstr "补充缺失的信息或添加必要的引导步骤"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:101
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:107
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Some preparatory steps must be taken before editing the FreeBSD "
"documentation.  First, subscribe to the {freebsd-doc}.  Some team members "
"also interact on the `#bsddocs` IRC channel on http://www.efnet.org/"
"[EFnet].  These people can help with questions or problems involving the "
"documentation."
msgstr "编辑 FreeBSD 文档前，需要先完成一些准备工作。首先，订阅 {freebsd-doc}。一些团队成员也会在 link:http://www.efnet.org/[EFnet] 上的 `#bsddocs` IRC 频道交流。这些人可以帮助解答文档相关的问题或处理相关困难。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:109
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "FreeBSD installation process"
msgstr "FreeBSD 安装流程"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:114
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Install these packages. The `docproj` _meta-port_ installs all the "
"applications required to do useful work with the FreeBSD documentation."
msgstr "安装以下软件包。`docproj` __元端口__ 会安装使用 FreeBSD 文档进行有效工作的所有必需应用程序。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:118
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install docproj\n"
msgstr "# pkg install docproj\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:121
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:202
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:286
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Install a local working copy of the documentation from the FreeBSD "
"repository in [.filename]#~/doc# (see crossref:working-copy[working-copy,The "
"Working Copy])."
msgstr "将 FreeBSD 仓库中的文档安装为本地工作副本，存放在 [.filename]#~/doc# 中（参见 crossref:working-copy[working-copy,工作副本]）。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:125
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:206
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% git clone https://git.FreeBSD.org/doc.git ~/doc\n"
msgstr "% git clone https://git.FreeBSD.org/doc.git ~/doc\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:128
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:209
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:293
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Edit the documentation files that require changes. If a file needs major "
"changes, consult the mailing list for input."
msgstr "编辑需要修改的文档文件。如果文件需要大幅修改，请先向邮件列表征求意见。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:131
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Review the output and edit the file to fix any problems shown, then rerun "
"the command to find any remaining problems.  Repeat until all of the errors "
"are resolved."
msgstr "检查输出并编辑文件以修复其中显示的问题，然后重新运行命令以查找其他问题。重复此过程，直到解决所有错误。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:133
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"*_Always_* build and review the changes before submitting them. Running "
"`make` in the `documentation` or `website` subdirectories will generate the "
"documentation in HTML format."
msgstr "*_务必_* 在提交前构建并检查修改。在 `documentation` 或 `website` 子目录中运行 `make` 会生成 HTML 格式的文档。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:137
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% make\n"
msgstr "% make\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:140
#, fuzzy
msgid "To reduce compile time, only one language can be compiled:"
msgstr "为缩短编译时间，可以只编译一种语言："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:144
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% make DOC_LANG=en\n"
msgstr "% make DOC_LANG=en\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:147
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The build output is stored in [.filename]#~/doc/documentation/public/en/"
"articles/# and [.filename]#~/doc/documentation/public/en/books/#."
msgstr "构建输出存放在 [.filename]#~/doc/documentation/public/en/articles/# 和 [.filename]#~/doc/documentation/public/en/books/# 中。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:149
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Review the build output and ensure the edits are free from typos, layout "
"problems, or errors. If any errors are found during the build process, edit "
"the problematic files to fix any issues that show up, then run the build "
"command again until all errors are resolved."
msgstr "检查构建输出，确保修改没有拼写错误、布局问题或其他错误。如果构建过程中发现错误，请编辑有问题的文件并修复，然后重新运行构建命令，直到解决所有错误。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:151
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:221
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:304
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Add all the files with `git add .`, then review the diff with `git diff`. "
"For example:"
msgstr "使用 `git add .` 添加所有文件，然后用 `git diff` 检查差异。例如："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:156
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:226
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:309
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% git add .\n"
"% git diff --staged\n"
msgstr "% git add .\n% git diff --staged\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:159
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:229
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:312
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Make sure that all required files are included, then commit the change to "
"your local branch and generate a patch with `git format-patch`"
msgstr "确保包含所有必需文件，然后将修改提交到本地分支，并使用 `git format-patch` 生成补丁"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:164
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:234
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:317
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% git commit\n"
"% git format-patch -U999999 origin/main\n"
msgstr "% git commit\n% git format-patch -U999999 origin/main\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:167
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:237
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:320
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `-U999999` parameter adds as much context to the patch as possible which "
"makes reviewing easier."
msgstr "`-U999999` 参数会尽可能多地将上下文添加到补丁中，从而便于审查。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:170
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:240
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:323
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A patch file is generated as a result of `git format-patch` in the local "
"directory which will include author identity and email addresses, making it "
"easier for developers to apply (with `git am`) and give proper credit."
msgstr "`git format-patch` 会在本地目录中生成补丁文件，其中包含作者身份和电子邮件地址，方便开发者应用补丁（使用 `git am`）并正确署名。"

#. type: delimited block = 6
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:175
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:245
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:328
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To make it easier for committers to apply the patch on their working copy of "
"the documentation tree, please generate the [.filename]#.diff# from the base "
"of your documentation tree."
msgstr "为便于提交者将补丁应用到文档树的工作副本中，请从文档树的根目录生成 [.filename]#.diff# 文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:178
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the example above, changes have been made to the *bsdinstall* portion of "
"the Handbook."
msgstr "在上面的示例中，修改涉及《手册》的 *bsdinstall* 部分。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:185
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Submit the patch or diff file using the web-based https://bugs.FreeBSD.org/"
"bugzilla/enter_bug.cgi?product=Documentation[Problem Report] system.  In the "
"`Component` field, select the part of documentation the changes belong to.  "
"In the `Summary` field, enter a _short description of the problem_.  In the "
"`Description` field, enter a short description of the changes and any "
"important details about them.  Use the btn:[Add an attachment] button to "
"attach the patch or diff file.  Finally, use the btn:[Submit Bug] button to "
"submit the diff to the Problem Report system."
msgstr "使用基于 Web 的 link:https://bugs.FreeBSD.org/bugzilla/enter_bug.cgi?product=Documentation[问题报告]系统提交补丁或差异文件。在 `Component` 字段中，选择修改所属的文档部分。在 `Summary` 字段中填写问题的__简短描述__。在 `Description` 字段中简要说明修改内容及其重要细节。使用 btn:[Add an attachment] 按钮附加补丁或差异文件。最后，使用 btn:[Submit Bug] 按钮将差异文件提交到问题报告系统。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:188
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "GNU/Linux installation process"
msgstr "GNU/Linux 安装流程"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:195
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Install these packages in apt-based systems like Debian or Ubuntu.  On other "
"GNU/Linux distributions the package names may change.  Consult your "
"distribution's package manager if in doubt."
msgstr "在 Debian 或 Ubuntu 等基于 apt 的系统上安装以下软件包。在其他 GNU/Linux 发行版上，软件包名称可能不同。如有疑问，请查阅发行版的软件包管理器。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:199
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# apt install asciidoctor hugo ruby-asciidoctor-pdf ruby-rouge git bmake\n"
msgstr "# apt install asciidoctor hugo ruby-asciidoctor-pdf ruby-rouge git bmake\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:212
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:296
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Review the output and edit the files to fix any problems shown, then rerun "
"the command to find any remaining problems.  Repeat until all of the errors "
"are resolved."
msgstr "检查输出并编辑文件以修复其中显示的问题，然后重新运行命令以查找其他问题。重复此过程，直到解决所有错误。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:214
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:298
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Always build and test the changes before submitting them. Running `bmake` in "
"the `documentation` or `website` subdirectories will generate the "
"documentation in HTML format."
msgstr "提交前务必构建并测试修改。在 `documentation` 或 `website` 子目录中运行 `bmake` 会生成 HTML 格式的文档。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:218
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% bmake run LOCALBASE=/usr\n"
msgstr "% bmake run LOCALBASE=/usr\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:253
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:336
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Submit the patch or diff file using the web-based https://bugs.FreeBSD.org/"
"bugzilla/enter_bug.cgi?product=Documentation[Problem Report] system.  If "
"using the web form, enter a Summary of _short description of problem_.  "
"Select the Component `Documentation`.  In the Description field, enter a "
"short description of the problem in the _Summary_ field and add _patch_ to "
"the _Keywords_ field.  Use the btn:[Add an attachment] button to attach the "
"patch or diff file.  Finally, use the btn:[Submit Bug] button to submit your "
"diff to the problem report system."
msgstr "使用基于 Web 的 link:https://bugs.FreeBSD.org/bugzilla/enter_bug.cgi?product=Documentation[问题报告]系统提交补丁或差异文件。如果使用 Web 表单，请在 Summary 字段中填写问题的__简短描述__。将 Component 设为 `Documentation`。在 Description 字段中简要说明问题，并在 _Summary_ 字段中填写说明；在 _Keywords_ 字段中添加 _patch_。使用 btn:[Add an attachment] 按钮附加补丁或差异文件。最后，使用 btn:[Submit Bug] 按钮将差异文件提交到问题报告系统。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:256
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "macOS(R) installation process"
msgstr "macOS(R) 安装流程"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:262
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Install these packages using link:https://brew.sh/[Homebrew] and link:"
"https://rubygems.org/[RubyGem]."
msgstr "使用 link:https://brew.sh/[Homebrew] 和 link:https://rubygems.org/[RubyGem] 安装以下软件包。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:266
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "$ brew install hugo ruby git bmake\n"
msgstr "$ brew install hugo ruby git bmake\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:269
#, fuzzy
msgid "Add Ruby to the Path."
msgstr "将 Ruby 添加到 Path 中。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/overview/_index.adoc:277
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"$ echo 'export PATH=\"$(brew --prefix ruby)/bin:$PATH\"' >> ~/.zshrc\n"
"$ echo 'export PATH=\"$(brew --prefix hugo)/bin:$PATH\"' >> ~/.zshrc\n"
"$ echo 'export GEM_PATH=\"$(gem environment gemdir)\"' >> ~/.zshrc\n"
"$ echo 'export PATH=\"${GEM_PATH}/bin:$PATH\"' >> ~/.zshrc\n"
